Xiao Qiang, Xiao Ming, and Xiao Yong participated in a mathematics competition. They are from schools A, B, and C respectively, and each won first, second, and third prizes. The known conditions are:  
(1) Xiao Qiang is not from school A;  
(2) Xiao Ming is not from school B;  
(3) The contestant from school A did not win the first prize;  
(4) The contestant from school B won the second prize;  
(5) Xiao Ming did not win the third prize.  

Based on the above information, it can be concluded that Xiao Yong is the contestant from school A, and he won the third prize.

